WEBVTT

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:07.110
How much further?

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:10.190
Another 700 meters.
Right beyond the wall partition!

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:11.190
Huh?

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:12.610
Hold on tight!

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:22.250
We're going to smash our way through!

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.500
Main server link opened.

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:29.500
Forcing system connection!

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:21.140
Looks like we were able to make it in.

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:23.950
B-But...

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:26.040
What is this?

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:33.590
This is the world that King reigns over.

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:39.630
King continues to live by absorbing
human souls and consuming them.

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:42.800
I will take care of him.

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:46.370
I'll head to the storage unit with her.

00:02:46.930 --> 00:02:47.730
Sophie.

00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:48.620
Huh?

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:50.630
Here they come!

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:11.040
The immaturity in your 
attacks has disappeared.

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:13.250
However, it is still not enough!

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:17.420
This is a date course I planned just for you!

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:23.630
I won't let you go to Sword.

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:25.850
Be careful!

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:31.480
This time, your bodies are logged
into the system along with your data.

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:33.100
Our bodies?

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:37.820
Yes, to fully allow you to use
your powers as a Makai Knight.

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:38.820
In exchange...

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:43.700
I can't forcibly return you to
the real world like I did last time.

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:47.450
Take this chance and go!

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:50.370
Lizzy. Take care of Sophie.

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:52.830
Leave it to me, Brother.

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:09.390
Hey. Um. Are you really Sword's...?

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:10.890
Yes, I'm his little sister.

00:04:11.390 --> 00:04:15.350
Though, a lot of things
happened and now I'm like this.

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:19.230
Sophie, please free everyone's souls.

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:23.820
You're the only one who can
deactivate the ELDO NET system.

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:26.240
It's all right.

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:29.420
I'll give you the support you need.

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:33.010
Yeah.

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:40.550
Look, that's the access terminal
that connects to the main storage unit

00:04:40.550 --> 00:04:42.030
within the system.

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:50.600
Your training in close-combat
shooting is lacking!

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:58.360
The inability to cut away
the past, that is your limit.

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:03.700
I will not cut anything away.

00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:10.410
Even so, I will surpass you, Dark Knight!

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:13.630
We're going to access the system now.

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:16.040
But, what should I do?

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:21.060
Only you and the developer,
Martin Hennes, have administrator access.

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:26.370
We have to access the main terminal
and find the deactivation password.

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:34.540
What?

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:43.900
This is...!

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:57.980
Here, humans are mere sustenance,

00:06:57.980 --> 00:07:04.500
fated to sacrifice their
lives to me for all eternity.

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:09.280
In the void within me,
everything has become one.

00:07:09.780 --> 00:07:13.380
This is true and complete peace.

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:20.040
Within the void, everything 
will lose its light.

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:23.630
Wh-What happened?

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:26.250
It's King's security program.

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:28.630
He's finally shown himself.

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:32.470
So it's better not to do anything.

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:37.140
Hey there, ladies.
I'm here to play with you two.

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:06.170
Such a dull blade cannot cut me.

00:08:27.650 --> 00:08:32.610
I can't lose, no matter what...
To a fallen alchemist like you!

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:25.280
You never change.

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:27.480
All of you.

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:32.950
No matter the era,
you reject annihilation and struggle.

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:39.550
No matter how many times I crush you,
you pop up like pestilent insects.

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:49.210
Lizzy.

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:02.030
Sophie?!

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:06.410
You can't! You'll disappear
if you keep interacting with it!

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:09.320
Why don't you all give up already?

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:14.300
The Golden Knight you depend on
so much has already been murdered.

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:16.760
Sophie!

00:10:17.170 --> 00:10:21.680
Sword won't lose. Sword 
definitely won't lose!

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:25.310
Sword is the strongest of all Makai Knights!

00:10:26.770 --> 00:10:30.480
There is no longer anyone
who can lay a hand on this world.

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:35.730
All obstacles have disappeared,
bringing eternal peace.

00:10:37.190 --> 00:10:42.830
You're so freaking noisy.
Your monologue is too long.

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:44.330
Huh?

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:45.940
Why?!

00:10:47.710 --> 00:10:49.300
It's obvious.

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:53.180
Because that's what it means to "live."

00:10:54.840 --> 00:10:58.760
Everyone has them. Sad and painful things.

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:03.600
They don't lose to the pain that drops
them to their knees and keep living.

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:06.240
Even at this very moment.

00:11:07.100 --> 00:11:08.600
Even if it's painful.

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:10.920
Humans keep smiling because it's so painful.

00:11:11.730 --> 00:11:13.790
They believe in the hope of tomorrow.

00:11:15.190 --> 00:11:19.380
We fight to protect that future.

00:11:22.910 --> 00:11:23.860
That's why...

00:11:25.450 --> 00:11:27.240
We stand up as many times as it takes.

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:31.710
As many times as it takes...

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:34.540
We swing our blade.

00:11:38.300 --> 00:11:40.630
As long as our arms and legs still move...

00:11:45.010 --> 00:11:47.390
...we will protect humankind!

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:49.280
That is one who protects!

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:52.340
That is Golden Knight

00:11:54.880 --> 00:11:56.020
Garo!

00:11:58.480 --> 00:12:03.860
Fine. I shall erase you,
so that mouth can never again smile.

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:18.840
I won't let you go.

00:12:21.050 --> 00:12:25.840
Even if my body crumbles,
I will not let you reach him!

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:29.600
You bastard...

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:41.620
This is?!

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:46.870
Sophie, let's go!

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:47.640
Yeah!

00:13:50.550 --> 00:13:52.670
My lord, King.

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:15.450
You better be sure to make it back...

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:49.530
Sword! These things are just pieces
of data! There's no end to them!

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:52.450
Then we have to attack the source!

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:01.390
Shit!

00:15:24.150 --> 00:15:25.690
It is useless.

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:29.900
I am this very world.
A sword cannot cut me down.

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:39.910
Then, I'll just have
to destroy the entire world.

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:41.010
Zaruba!

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:03.580
Sword, use this!

00:16:04.310 --> 00:16:05.520
Yeah!

00:16:15.820 --> 00:16:17.190
Let's go!

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:36.970
Golden Knight.

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:57.320
Oh, my? What is this?

00:16:57.530 --> 00:17:00.450
King disappeared...

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:01.410
Sophie!

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:05.470
You can only save your brother
by destroying the storage unit!

00:17:06.210 --> 00:17:08.710
I don't want anyone else to die.

00:17:09.380 --> 00:17:10.670
So...

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:14.630
So please lend me power!

00:17:14.800 --> 00:17:18.100
I want to protect Sword! Everyone!

00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:46.420
It's all right, Sophie.

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:49.180
I'll always be by your side.

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:51.020
Martin...

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:57.570
But, I'm sorry. In the end,
I wasn't able to keep my promise.

00:17:58.430 --> 00:18:06.310
That's not true! I know, you know?
You always did your best for me.

00:18:07.310 --> 00:18:11.690
I've always been
so happy to be your little sister.

00:18:12.570 --> 00:18:16.680
Smile, Sophie. Always. Forever.

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:20.260
Yeah, Brother.

00:18:43.890 --> 00:18:46.520
Sophie! Sophie!

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:49.160
Sophie! Are you all right?

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:36.880
Thank you, Brother.

00:20:00.340 --> 00:20:03.660
So this is the path you choose.

00:20:05.510 --> 00:20:07.630
You would never understand.

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:23.980
With this, ELDO NET will disappear.

00:20:25.530 --> 00:20:30.580
I have to go soon,
please take care of my brother for me.

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:33.290
Yeah, leave it to me.

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:39.300
Oh! Tell him that he needs
to eat his spinach properly.

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:40.440
Yeah.

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:43.490
Good-bye.

00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:50.670
Good-bye, Lizzy.

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:11.870
I haven't been this exhausted in a long time.

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:14.510
Let's go home and grab a bite to eat.

00:21:14.730 --> 00:21:15.830
No, wait...

00:21:16.250 --> 00:21:20.840
I'll say it again. Even if you pick up
a woman, don't let her ride me.

00:21:22.260 --> 00:21:24.340
I didn't say anything, yet.
